# Probe 345 (lowering): a positional written Structure `(y: 6)` for the Structure formal p of take; entry 7.
Point:
    int: x 1
    int: y 2
end: Point
fn: take (Point: p; int: q 2) int
    return: p\y * 10 + q
end: take
int: code 7
if: take((y: 6)) != 62
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
